THAT implementation provenance

Paper: THAT: Token-wise High-frequency Augmentation Transformer for Hyperspectral
Pansharpening, IEEE SMC 2025. DOI: 10.1109/SMC58881.2025.11343459.

The model was reorganized from an existing local research implementation. Its
attention code explicitly credits DRSformer:
https://github.com/cschenxiang/DRSformer
The window-attention implementation was inherited through a HAT/TTST-derived
local backbone. These origins are acknowledged; no claim of independent
creation or blanket relicensing of third-party code is made here.

